    {
      "id": "5a1676p",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Chemical Properties of Non-metals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2twt31z",
      "content": "• Non-metals react with oxygen to form non-metal oxides."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x1b4tgp",
      "content": "• Non-metals gain electrons to form negative ions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1645jxw",
      "content": "• They usually do not react with acids."
    },
    {
      "id": "wak7nym",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Reactivity Series of Metals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y9w4tcs",
      "content": "The reactivity series is a list of metals arranged in decreasing order of reactivity."
    },
    {
